# Model-backed repair proposals are optional. Without any of these, DepSherpa still runs
# recipes, the isolated upgrade, and every report; it just records `agent_unavailable`
# for failures no recipe covers.
#
# Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint:
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# DEPSHERPA_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini
#
# In GitHub Actions, pass the same values through the `openai-api-key` and `openai-base-url`
# inputs (from a repository secret / variable). GitHub Models was retired on 2026-07-30, so
# there is no zero-configuration model in Actions; recipes need no model at all.
